# R8 keep rules for the androidTest component (AGP 9 keepRules convention).
# espresso transitively pulls errorprone annotations that reference the JDK's
# javax.lang.model, which does not exist on Android (S2-04 device run).
-dontwarn javax.lang.model.**

# The instrumentation entry points (runner + JUnit4 test classes) are loaded
# reflectively by androidx.test; without this the shrunk test APK crashes with
# ClassNotFoundException (kotlin.LazyKt) and reports "0 tests". Test APK size
# is irrelevant — keep everything.
-keep class ** { *; }
-keep class kotlin.** { *; }
-keep class androidx.test.** { *; }
-dontobfuscate
